{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Backyard Digger is a relaxing game about digging in your backyard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover what lies beneath your lawn \u2014 it might be more than just dirt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mine valuable metals, uncover hidden treasures, and stumble upon abandoned mines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sell everything you find and upgrade your tools to dig deeper and more efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Avoid dangers like falling rocks, extreme heat, and the risk of crashing as you descend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reach the very bottom and uncover the unknown secrets hidden in Backyard Digger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experience immersive, physics-based soil destruction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264640/extras/Destruction.gif?t=1749118892\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Uncover hundreds of meters of hidden depths</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264640/extras/Depths.gif?t=1749118892\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>And beware of what you'll find...</strong><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264640/extras/Ending.gif?t=1749118892\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3264640?t=1749118892","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3264640?t=1749118892","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264640/0480c5c9d56e5f6dd43248880a6d9ec73b1680f0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749118892","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akama